# LF everywhere. A CRLF checkout once poisoned the editor.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.wasm binary

# GitHub guesses the language by counting bytes.
# The guide is generated from README.md and is documentation, not source.
docs/** linguist-documentation
docs/index.html linguist-generated
examples/wasm_gallery/Inter-Regular.subset.ttf linguist-vendored
# The generator builds the documentation and is not what this repo is written
# in. Without this line the whole repo reads as Python, which is a plain lie.
tools/guide.py linguist-documentation
